y early stage."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>A migrant boat sank off the coast of Djibouti with the UN reporting over 200 people dead or missing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d63522ef59f2e29036c8b3a24076348e34374af41939c38f80170d03bae3f345</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:59:25Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T11:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/a-migrant-boat-sank-off-the-coast-of-djibouti-with-the-un-reporting-over-200-people-dead-or-missing/a-79633644--4aa98f08da51.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/a-migrant-boat-sank-off-the-coast-of-djibouti-with-the-un-reporting-over-200-people-dead-or-missing/a-79633644?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The UN migration agency has reported that at least 139 people were killed and 84 remain missing after a migrant boat sank overnight on its way to Yemen. At least 80 Ethiopians survived the incident but 15 children died.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Poland on alert amid possible attack on PM, defense minister</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:54d56a8779350c75aed55f479b98a7820c60d760bb7deb7ce98687e8486137b2</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:59:28Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T10:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/poland-on-alert-amid-possible-attack-on-pm-defense-minister/a-79633128--17a6f36df605.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/poland-on-alert-amid-possible-attack-on-pm-defense-minister/a-79633128?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Poland was holding an emergency meeting after police received information about a possible assassination plot against PM Donald Tusk. The meeting comes amid a wave of violence at Polish schools this week.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Pakistan: President puts Khan stronghold province under emergency rule</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1cdc4fa84e65233cb7