will have more older people, fewer workers, and a smaller population overall. Yet some regions will defy this trend. Their success depends on how much they have to offer.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Ukrainian prisoners of war and defectors have been gathered into a Russian battalion to face Ukrainian forces — why? And how?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:788f077cfc6e7f2ce101373260c93a44ab623c49f2e44ef81c28f0b92ad9aa83</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:59:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T06:38:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukrainian-prisoners-of-war-and-defectors-have-been-gathered-into-a-russian-battalion-to-face-ukraini/a-79629555--1a0d943eb25d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukrainian-prisoners-of-war-and-defectors-have-been-gathered-into-a-russian-battalion-to-face-ukrainian-forces-why-and-how/a-79629555?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Russia has announced a battalion consisting of Ukrainian "volunteers." But veterans and former prisoners of war share very different accounts.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India's 'Cockroach' movement leaders say 'the fight has just begun' after a large protest in Delhi</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3539507f172358ebe411da46d011ffecc7226a6a779d74fff036d6e73e737db0</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:59:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T05:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-s-cockroach-movement-leaders-say-the-fight-has-just-begun-after-a-large-protest-in-delhi/live-79631190--6c364b108dbc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-s-cockroach-movement-leaders-say-the-fight-has-just-begun-after-a-large-protest-in-delhi/live-79631190?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Leaders of the youth-led protest movement demanding India's election commissioner step down say the "fight has just begun" after they were released from detention following a large demonstration in Delhi. More on DW.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US: Justice Department probes Trump's press pool boycott for antitrust violation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3672c5f6f468a426746c463558d6b2e90805e3ed5bf79d8b452a234444e0ca28</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:58:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T03:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-justice-department-probes-trump-s-press-pool-boycott-for-antitrust-violation/a-79631008--8b147e1a6531.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-justice-department-probes-trump-s-press-pool-boycott-for-antitrust-violation/a-79631008?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Department of Justice is investigating whether the five news organizations violated antitrust laws when they suspended their coverage of Trump in protest. The networks under probe are ABC, CBS, CNN, NBC and Fox News.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Shooter kills 8 people and himself in Pennsylvania — police</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3922f243a02994d14d5b2b3bee170b529ef0f08f1260e790d3bd5a000ec4acef</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:58:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-11T01:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/shooter-kills-8-people-and-himself-in-pennsylvania-police/a-79630735--bb0e9431445c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/shooter-kills-8-people-and-himself-in-pennsylvania-police/a-79630735?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The 45-year-old shooter, who is yet to be identified, carried out the killings at his home in Erie. Pennsylvania Governor Josh Shapiro offered support as the lakeside city grieves.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Storm Isaias leaves 4 dead as it moves across southern US</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dfbe6e9a8e97112367d16748eb65306ac5af3db7f91bce94bf8b3995c936fee5</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:58:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T23:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/storm-isaias-leaves-4-dead-as-it-moves-across-southern-us/a-79630125--e52061ff181f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/storm-isaias-leaves-4-dead-as-it-moves-across-southern-us/a-79630125?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The storm, which is now a post-tropical cyclone, had made landfall near Destin, Florida on Friday evening. The storm brings heavy rainfall and powerful winds and has caused mass power outages in Florida and Alabama.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Palestinian president postpones elections until late 2027</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7756f3701a3c0a6e8b89ca26f5735b8b5336c106fc6122bfcb58f8d3338fe09b</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:58:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T22:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/palestinian-president-postpones-elections-until-late-2027/a-79630075--cc7afbd0735f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/palestinian-president-postpones-elections-until-late-2027/a-79630075?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Palestinian President Mahmoud Abbas previously committed to holding legislative elections in November 2026. He said that due to "obstacles ⁠posed by Israeli measures" the vote would be pushed back until late next year.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Saudi Arabia: 12 killed, hundreds injured in Riyadh airport attack</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:11ab2caead3d99f334fb2e8efa4c5858add812f6b83e7ad6cd720db24a8de5e2</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:58:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T22:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-12-killed-hundreds-injured-in-riyadh-airport-attack/a-79628862--fd8ba45fcc27.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-12-killed-hundreds-injured-in-riyadh-airport-attack/a-79628862?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Saudi-led coalition has vowed a "decisive" response after the deadliest strike on Saudi soil in over a decade. Officials have pinned the attack on Iran-backed Houthi militia in Yemen.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Money, networks and bias: Why women struggle to win seats in US politics</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4cba876c77b22793b169edf120e41a967b055a8678c107d87e040c4c0bae2b4a</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:58:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T19:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/money-networks-and-bias-why-women-struggle-to-win-seats-in-us-politics/a-79625179--d768d0a80615.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/money-networks-and-bias-why-women-struggle-to-win-seats-in-us-politics/a-79625179?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US is holding Congress and state governor elections. At all levels of US politics, women are underrepresented — but they may win some historic victories in the midterms on November 3.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Eritrea urges UN deterrence measures against Ethiopia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fd0da6be2edc6671215936772137556d09ef280b86ce2999ca7193973687a74d</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:58:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T18:32:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eritrea-urges-un-deterrence-measures-against-ethiopia/a-79629670--3be24e605304.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eritrea-urges-un-deterrence-measures-against-ethiopia/a-79629670?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Eritrea has officially requested UN Security Council assistance over the conflict in Tigray. Both Eritrea and Ethiopia accuse each other of fueling regional instability.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump slams Zelenskyy, says Ukraine should elect new president</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d14cec3cd16819692957d4cb55a6b3697fc5adfbc9cc414b239cd1ab0b457739</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:58:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T17:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-slams-zelenskyy-says-ukraine-should-elect-new-president/a-79629740--e4368c941303.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-slams-zelenskyy-says-ukraine-should-elect-new-president/a-79629740?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">President Trump has criticized Volodymyr Zelenskyy for not making a deal with Russia to end the Ukraine war. Trump also warned Kyiv against targeting Russian oil refineries that will supply the US with diesel fuel.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'Ragebait' is the 2026 German Youth Word of the Year</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0dd659ba3ca4b693024b410ed7f2f57dd95abed596f060646d4d58cc8fbf003e</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:58:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T13:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ragebait-is-the-2026-german-youth-word-of-the-year/a-79608158--c39c4c350c71.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ragebait-is-the-2026-german-youth-word-of-the-year/a-79608158?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Already named the 2025 Oxford Word of the Year, "rage bait" has also been widely adopted in German slang.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Operations Plan Germany: How the Bundeswehr trains for NATO collective defense</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7f79ecd7ab251ca3cb4d7ff7d49afa8d8ae4192938a95788ad4433ed3bcc5233</id><updated>2026-10-11T14:58:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T12:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/operations-plan-germany-how-the-bundeswehr-trains-for-nato-collective-defense/a-79553793--d1447370a9ee.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/operations-plan-germany-how-the-bundeswehr-trains-for-nato-collective-defense/a-79553793?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">How prepared is Germany for national defense? The answer lies in the Operations Plan Germany. Military exercises such as "Red Storm Charlie" are designed to put these preparations to the test in realistic scenarios.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry></feed>
